# Cloudflare Pages routing.
#   /            -> dist/index.html        (static, non-WASM landing page)
#   /app, /app/* -> dist/app/index.html    (WASM SPA + client-side router fallback)
# The 200 status rewrites without changing the URL, so deep links and refreshes
# inside the app (e.g. /app/portfolio) load the SPA host and let the router take over.
/app           /app/index.html   200
/app/*         /app/index.html   200
